# {ProjectName} — Web-Novel Writing Toolkit (ZCode)

This project is wired into ZCode through oh-story. Prefer invoking a Skill with `$skill-name`; you can also pick the same-named Skill or Command from the `/` panel.

## Skill Routing Table

| Command / intent | Skill | Description |
|---|---|---|
| `$story-long-write`, write long-form | story-long-write | Long-form web-novel writing (chapter by chapter) |
| `$story-short-write`, write short-form | story-short-write | Short-form web-novel writing (emotion-driven) |
| `$story-long-analyze`, long-form teardown | story-long-analyze | Deep teardown of a long-form novel |
| `$story-short-analyze`, short-form teardown | story-short-analyze | Teardown analysis of a short-form novel |
| `$story-long-scan`, long-form market scan | story-long-scan | Long-form novel rankings and market trends |
| `$story-short-scan`, short-form market scan | story-short-scan | Short-form novel rankings and emotional windows |
| `$story-deslop`, de-AI-flavor | story-deslop | Removes AI writing traces |
